**Final method decision (REQ-003/004/005):** inventory via mcp-notion reads (24 MCP + 5 API gaps) → human-driven Importer bulk (Mode A) → headless file-layer reconstruction via mcp-obsidian (Mode B: relations, rollups, formulas, comments, views) → 11-check parity verification. Required plugins: Core Bases + Notion Bases community plugin + Dataview. The entire reconstruction + verification pipeline is headless-capable.

